        {
          "text": "Mutabi nomuleya nkaambo kanjiisyo zyamisyobo misyobo, nkaambo ncecibotu kuti moyo ube anguzu zizwa kuluzyalo, kutali kuzilyo, nkobakalisanga abo abakabula ancobajana, ",
