                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo abo banyama bali abulowa butolwa amupaizi mupati mu-Busena Busalala, kuti cibe Cituuzyo cazibi, mitunta yabo ilatentelwa anze lyamalawo. ",
          "type": "text",
